  "instructions": [
    "Heat sesame oil in a skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add minced garlic and ginger and sauté for 30 seconds.",
    "Add sliced bell pepper and shallot and stir-fry until slightly softened, about 3 minutes.",
    "Pour in kombu dashi, soy sauce, and black pepper, bringing to a gentle simmer.",
    "Cook the mixture until the sauce thickens and the vegetables are tender, about 5 minutes.",
    "Fold in pico de gallo and chopped green onion, cooking for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Remove from heat and drizzle with a little sesame oil.",
    "Sprinkle with sesame seeds before serving.",
    "Plate the dish on a wooden board for an authentic presentation.",
    "Serve immediately while hot."
  ],
